    <sectiondef kind="private-func">
      <memberdef kind="function" id="classcsmp_1_1_brittle_failure_visitor_1a5087cdb2342742ab3a8018256b8c6fbc" prot="private" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>void</type>
        <definition>void csmp::BrittleFailureVisitor&lt; dim &gt;::InitializeInputProperties</definition>
        <argsstring>(Element&lt; dim &gt; *)</argsstring>
        <name>InitializeInputProperties</name>
        <qualifiedname>csmp::BrittleFailureVisitor::InitializeInputProperties</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_element" kindref="compound">Element</ref>&lt; dim &gt; *</type>
          <defname>eptr</defname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Reads all relevant rock and fluid properties from the element. Missing parameters are computed from correlations:</para>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>UCS is calculated from E and the Hoek-Brown failure envelope.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>pstar = compactive strength is estimated from UCS</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>G and B are calculated from E and nu assuming perfect linear elasticity </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
        <location file="source/includes/thmc/mechanics/BrittleFailureVisitor.h" line="39" column="10" bodyfile="source/modules/thmc/mechanics/BrittleFailureVisitor.cpp" bodystart="74" bodyend="97"/>
      </memberdef>
    </sectiondef>
    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Evaluates (brittle) shear and tensile failure criteria that are output to the element integration points.</para>
<para>Input variables:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>friction angle</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>cohesion (scalar)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>stress (tensor) = Cartesian stress</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>fluid pressure (if this variable is not specified its value is assumed to be zero)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Biot coefficient</para>
<para><xrefsect id="todo_1_todo000220"><xreftitle>Todo</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>SKM: this visitor should include the influence of pore pressure.</para>
</xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
